5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe we should look at the history of our successes. I will check the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the human element. I will examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Infrastructure is often the silent failure point. I'll look into accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I want to see where the money actually goes. I'll check the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about external interruptions. I will look at the station records from partner field sites and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
